		{
			dependencies: ["67D795138452C742"]
			description: [
				"Mana and Artifice provides a pretty awesome way of locating any structure you want, its called: the thaumaturgic compass!"
				""
				"the thaumaturgic compass will always point towared a structure of the type its bound, you can shift-right-click it to search again for the nearest one!"
				""
				"it is made using the ritual of locating, the structure type to which it is bound is decided by the thaumaturgic link used in the ritual."
				""
				"the thaumaturgic links can all be bought from the wandering wizard (summoned through the ritual of the wandering wizard) for one ventium ingot a piece"
			]
			id: "47F5FD6DA30A98A5"
			tasks: [{
